export anchor KaraokeLyricsStyle:
    number: 333
    screen: MusicPlayer
    name: Karaoke lyrics
    idea: The lyrics take over the screen, with the current line set huge and wiped in yellow as it is sung, a bouncing ball over the next word, the next line small beneath and every other control shrunk to rounded strips at the edges.
    base: dark
    palette:
        stagePlum: #140b22, the page, the lyric stage and the style sheet
        booth: #21143a, the top strip, the control pill, ticket cards and fields
        boothLine: #3d2c63, pill rims, the unplayed track and dividers
        sungYellow: #ffe14d, the sung words, their underline bar, the ball, the pause button and focus
        unsungWhite: #f6f1ff, the rest of the current line and main text
        lilac: #bdb1d8, the next line, artists, times and labels
        pink: #ff7ac6, the liked heart, ticket numbers and the progress fill
        onYellow: #1e1400, text on sung yellow
    type:
        One rounded stack, ui-rounded, SF Pro Rounded, Arial Rounded MT
        Bold, Nunito, system-ui, at heavy weights. Base 15px at 600. The
        current line is clamp 38 to 92px at 900 with 1.3 line height, the
        next line clamp 20 to 30px at 700, the strip title 17px at 800,
        ticket titles 16px at 800, and caps labels 12px at 800 with 0.14em
        tracking.
    layout:
        Lyrics first. A rounded top strip holds a yellow Sing along badge,
        Harbour Lights, the artist and Low Tide, and Brightwork Sound on
        the right. The middle of the screen, at least half its height, is
        the lyric stage, with Lyrics, line 1 of 2 over the current line
        centred and huge. And the harbour lights go is sung, in yellow with
        a soft glow and a thick rounded yellow underline, a yellow ball sits
        over out, and out one by one stays white. The next line follows
        much smaller in lilac after a small caps Next. A long rounded
        control pill holds round previous, a larger yellow pause and next,
        a fat pink progress bar between the elapsed and total time, pills
        for Shuffle Off, Repeat Off and Liked with a pink heart, and a
        volume bar with 70%. Below, Up next to sing shows five rounded
        ticket cards with a pink numbered disc, the time, the title and the
        artist, and Your songbook lists the playlists with counts and pill
        links for Albums, Artists and Podcasts. Below 1100px the control
        pill stacks into rows and the songbook moves under the tickets,
        and below 560px the line drops to 36px and tickets stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 48px around the lyric stage, 12px inside pills and 16px between groups.
    density: Very low in the middle, compact at the edges.
    corners: Fully rounded strip, control pill, buttons and fields, 20px ticket cards and songbook.
    borders: 2px booth line rims on pills, buttons and tickets. The sung words carry a thick rounded yellow underline.
    shadows: Only a soft yellow glow of 24px at 40 percent behind the sung words and the ball.
    icons:
        Chunky solid glyphs in round buttons. A yellow ball marks the next
        word, and sung words are underlined as well as yellow. Liked is a
        filled pink heart with the word Liked. Toggles say Off.
    focus: A 3px yellow outline offset 3px, following the pill shape.
    tone: Friendly and loud, such as Sing along, Up next to sing, Your songbook and Next.
